INSTEAD OF WATCHING NETFLIX TONIGHT, SPEND 1 HOUR WITH THIS.

LINKEDIN LEAD-GEN MASTERCLASS that teaches you how to DESIGN infographics and STRUCTURE posts that actually book demos.

@PierreReddot walks me through the PAS hook, the save-rate trick, and why 95% of posts fail.

@Tycho_luijten There's a name for what you're describing. 

Curse of knowledge. 

Once you're the expert you genuinely can't remember what it felt like not to know, so you skip the parts an outsider finds interesting.

Everyone tells you to post on LinkedIn. Nobody shows you how to get the people on your team doing it.

@kaibrandt_ built Enginy in public and got his whole team posting, until it became one of their biggest sources of pipeline.

So we broke down the whole program: the formats that go viral, the incentive program that makes people post every week, and how those likes and comments turn into closed deals:

@clay is going to be a $100b company

and I'll get https://t.co/a4fvoZyVYA to 1% of that within the next couple of years

stay tuned
